WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.075
Five apps. Forty notifications. One question
nobody can answer: what's actually done?

00:00:05.355 --> 00:00:10.872
Loopdesk puts every task, file, and deadline
in one place your whole team can see,

00:00:10.872 --> 00:00:14.550
so nothing hides in a chat thread or inbox anymore.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.280
Assign a task in two clicks.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:22.018
Comment where the work lives, so the answer
stays with the task.

00:00:22.298 --> 00:00:26.720
And when a deadline is near, you get
one quiet, polite reminder,

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.299
not five pings from five different places.

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:34.789
On the left, the old way: updates scattered
across chats, inboxes, and spreadsheets.

00:00:34.789 --> 00:00:42.404
On the right, one shared board. Everyone sees
the same work, the same priorities, and the same next step.

00:00:42.404 --> 00:00:44.408
No chasing. Just finishing work.

00:00:44.688 --> 00:00:48.205
Try it free for fourteen days. No card required.

00:00:48.205 --> 00:00:54.459
Set up your first board in minutes, invite your team,
and cancel in one click today.

00:00:54.739 --> 00:00:59.947
Loopdesk. Your team's work, in one calm place.
Start your free trial today.
